# Note: projects/financial-apps/financial-simulator is also tracked as a
# gitlink (see git ls-tree HEAD) but has no remote configured locally,
# so it has no working .gitmodules entry. Either push it to a remote
# and add an entry here, or convert it to a regular tracked subdirectory
# with: git rm --cached projects/financial-apps/financial-simulator
# followed by removing the inner .git/ and re-adding the contents.
